{
 "_comment": [
  "SIZE-TIER extension of ../ask_patterns.json (2026-10-01). Read ONLY by",
  "`gen_realspeech --tier 10k|40k`; the base build never opens this file, so",
  "the committed 1,200 rows cannot move. Merge rule (gen_realspeech.merge_banks):",
  "`asks` and new `structures` are ADDED (a key collision is an error); a",
  "structure already in the base file gets the extra `registers` listed here",
  "appended, which yields NEW family slugs and leaves every base slug as it was.",
  "Three registers are new here — hedge (tentative: 'i think', 'maybe'), narr",
  "(narrated: 'so tomorrow at 3 i've got'), frag (dictated fragments) — and two",
  "ask classes: c = complete_todo, r = delete_todo. Everything is invented and",
  "generic, written for this file; same placeholder contract as the base."
 ],
